 ter showtime.\n\nTickets are available at the door UNLESS tickets have sold
  out.\n\nGuests must be 18+for entry. Those under the age of 21 will be giv
 en wristbands to wear.\n\nALL SALES ARE FINAL. NO REFUNDS. This includes sw
 itching of showtimes\, once purchased all sales are final.\n\nManagement re
